province = 7
blurb = "Depicts travelers climbing Fudō Pass in the Mikuni Mountains of Kōzuke Province (present-day Gunma prefecture).

Clouds rise from gullies on either side of the path, and an orange sun appears in the distance. Two travelers at the right wash their hands in a waterfall, while an image of the Esoteric Buddhist deity Fudō Myō-ō at the upper right watches over the pass.

From the series Famous Views of the Provinces."
